403
00:21:48.670 --> 00:21:49.670
Nikki?

404
00:21:49.970 --> 00:21:51.070
Jste v pořádku?

405
00:21:51.550 --> 00:21:52.550
Jsi v pořádku?

406
00:21:54.730 --> 00:21:56.750
