Mně je to jedno.

773
00:44:52.990 --> 00:44:53.990
Bylo to úžasné, zlato.

774
00:44:57.720 --> 00:44:58.720
Ano.

775
00:45:31.680 --> 00:45:32.680
Nikki?

776
00:45:47.360 --> 00:45:48.460
